AFFIDAVIT OF PW-1 (Wife of Deceased)

I, Smt. [Name], wife of late Vikram Singh, resident of Village Kharwa, Udaipur, do hereby solemnly affirm and declare as follows:

1. That I am the wife of the deceased Vikram Singh who was murdered on 14.03.2025.

2. That on the night of 14.03.2025, my husband left home around 22:30 hours to go to our agricultural field.

3. That my husband returned home around 23:30 hours in an injured condition.

4. That before dying, my husband told me that he was attacked by Ramesh Chandra Meena and Suresh Meena with a wooden stick.

5. That my husband named the accused persons specifically.

6. That there was a long-standing land dispute between our family and the accused persons.

7. That I immediately informed the police next morning.

8. That I identify the accused persons as the murderers of my husband.

Solemnly affirmed at Udaipur on this ___ day of ______, 2025.

DEPONENT

Verified at Udaipur on this ___ day of ______, 2025 that the contents of this affidavit are true to my knowledge.

DEPONENT